msgstr "**Observation Tools** (``readonly=True``, ``kind=\"observe\"``)"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/concepts.rst:230
msgid "具有单个 ``agent_id`` 参数的智能体特定观察："
